step_details.raw_response:
Thought: Test a robust baseline by averaging all models in pool_full to gauge performance.  
Action: evaluate_strategy  
Action Input: {"combine":"mean","pool":"pool_full"}

Thought: Test a weighted combination using inverse error on the full pool to see if weighting improves over plain mean.  
Action: evaluate_strategy  
Action Input: {"combine":"weighted","pool":"pool_full","weights":"inverse_error"}

Thought: Test a robust median combination on the full pool to see if it improves over the mean.  
Action: evaluate_strategy  
Action Input: {"combine":"median","pool":"pool_full"}

Thought: Try a trimmed mean on the full pool to see if trimming improves over plain mean.  
Action: evaluate_strategy  
Action Input: {"combine":"trimmed_mean","pool":"pool_full","trim_pct":0.2}

Thought: Try a best_single strategy with ETS to see if a single top model beats the mean.  
Action: evaluate_strategy  
Action Input: {"combine":"best_single","model":"ETS"}

Thought: Test a dba combination on the full pool to see if an iterative robust average can beat the best_single ETS.  
Action: evaluate_strategy  
Action Input: {"combine":"dba","pool":"pool_full","dba_max_iter":30}

Thought: Try a weighted combination on the smaller, high‑performing pool1 using inverse_error weights to see if focusing on the top models improves over best_single ETS.

Action: evaluate_strategy

Action Input: {"combine":"weighted","pool":"pool1","weights":"inverse_error"}

Thought: Test a weighted combination using the pooled_meta_model handle (w1) on the full pool to see if a meta‑weighted approach improves over plain mean and inverse‑error weighting.  
Action: evaluate_strategy  
Action Input: {"combine":"weighted","pool":"pool_full","weights":"w1"}

Thought: Evaluate a weighted combination using inverse_error on the smaller robust pool1 to see if focusing on top models improves over best_single ETS.

Action: evaluate_strategy

Action Input: {"combine":"weighted","pool":"pool1","weights":"inverse_error"}

Thought: Evaluate a weighted combination on pool2 with inverse_error to see if a slightly larger pool improves over ETS single.  
Action: evaluate_strategy  
Action Input: {"combine":"weighted","pool":"pool2","weights":"inverse_error"}

Thought: Test a simple mean over the smaller, high‑performing pool1 to see if restricting the pool improves performance.  
Action: evaluate_strategy  
Action Input: {"combine":"mean","pool":"pool1","rationale":"Mean of top models in pool1"}

Thought: Test a trimmed mean on the smaller pool2 to see if trimming improves over mean and weighted on that pool.  
Action: evaluate_strategy  
Action Input: {"combine":"trimmed_mean","pool":"pool2","trim_pct":0.2}

Thought: Test a dba combination on the more selective pool1 to see if iterative robust averaging beats the best single ETS.  
Action: evaluate_strategy  
Action Input: {"combine":"dba","pool":"pool1","dba_max_iter":30}

